This module contains a Java port of parts of Google OR-Tools 10.0 (release
candidate, commit ca2ec93777; first ported from 9.15)
(https://github.com/google/or-tools), Copyright 2010-2025 Google LLC,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see the LICENSE file).

The files in the packages org.matheclipse.ortools.* were either ported from the
OR-Tools C++ sources to Java or adapted from the hand written OR-Tools Java wrapper
(ortools/java/com/google/ortools). The samples in src/test/java were adapted from
ortools/*/samples/java and the unit tests from ortools/javatests of OR-Tools and run
as JUnit tests.
Every such file keeps the original copyright notice and states that it was modified.

The CP-SAT solver (org.matheclipse.ortools.sat), the original constraint solver
(org.matheclipse.ortools.constraintsolver) and the routing library
(org.matheclipse.ortools.routing) are reimplementations of the OR-Tools
Java API on top of simpler search engines; they are not line by line ports of the
corresponding C++ code.
